  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/414",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size26\">1. 서울시 api 활용</span></b><br>&#160;<br>서울시&#160;각종&#160;환경정보지수(미세먼지,초미세먼지,&#160;오존,&#160;이산화질소,&#160;오존,&#160;일산화탄소,&#160;아황산가스)&#160;빅데이터&#160;활용&#160;수업&#160;웹앱<br>&#160;<br><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxCYlMoHEbQUq8UYlAEThlYa94WgD2f6l96jA6KCGPNVjVEjIkN8pS1tnIJpoo0gfCm3g/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxCYlMoHEbQUq8UYlAEThlYa94WgD2f6l96jA6KCGPNVjVEjIkN8pS1tnIJpoo0gfCm3g/exec</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"서울시 대기환경 통합 정보\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxCYlMoHEbQUq8UYlAEThlYa94WgD2f6l96jA6KCGPNVjVEjIkN8pS1tnIJpoo0gfCm3g/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxCYlMoHEbQUq8UYlAEThlYa94WgD2f6l96jA6KCGPNVjVEjIkN8pS1tnIJpoo0gfCm3g/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxCYlMoHEbQUq8UYlAEThlYa94WgD2f6l96jA6KCGPNVjVEjIkN8pS1tnIJpoo0gfCm3g/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxCYlMoHEbQUq8UYlAEThlYa94WgD2f6l96jA6KCGPNVjVEjIkN8pS1tnIJpoo0gfCm3g/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">서울시 대기환경 통합 정보</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>서울시 api 활용하여<br>각종&#160;환경정보지수(미세먼지,초미세먼지,&#160;오존,&#160;이산화질소,&#160;오존,&#160;일산화탄소,&#160;아황산가스)&#160;&#160;<br>실시간&#160;또는&#160;이전&#160;자료&#160;확인&#160;웹앱을<br>만들어 보았습니다.<br>&#160;<br>과학 영재학급 수업으로<br>위와 같은 과학 빅데이터 활용 분석하는 프로그램을 개발하는<br>수업을 하고 있습니다.<br>&#160;<br>수업의 예시로 만든 웹앱입니다.<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7ae766f3d31b008932d32368810be446e5a4b04\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7ae766f3d31b008932d32368810be446e5a4b04\" data-origin-width=\"1145\" data-origin-height=\"868\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>지도로 표시할 수 있게 하여 한눈에 보이게 하는 기능!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ac1460ea338f0271513aa48eb21cdcb1cd8fd45b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ac1460ea338f0271513aa48eb21cdcb1cd8fd45b\" data-origin-width=\"1094\" data-origin-height=\"831\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>항목별로 해당 권역(구역) 값에 따라 다르게 표시</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6b61708358ac34c964633753b3aad2ddac02779c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6b61708358ac34c964633753b3aad2ddac02779c\" data-origin-width=\"1083\" data-origin-height=\"782\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>서울시 주요 도로에서 측정되는 환경 값들&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9fabe987dd1221c768a68d80bf276a37af8cfda6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9fabe987dd1221c768a68d80bf276a37af8cfda6\" data-origin-width=\"1111\" data-origin-height=\"829\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>일정 기간의 데이터 조회 기능 및 항목별 최고값 최저값 의 권역 표시</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9aa26a84d6d8d7c35d99c36e3f5b16c088c849d2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9aa26a84d6d8d7c35d99c36e3f5b16c088c849d2\" data-origin-width=\"1104\" data-origin-height=\"818\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>&#160;-현재 황사 주의보 정보를 추가 해야 함!</b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size26\"><b>2. 기상청 api 활용</b> </span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">황사, 미세먼지 관련 경보/주의보가 내려졌을때</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">중국에서 바람이 불어온것일까??</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">즉,</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">중국에서 넘어오는 바람에 의해</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">황사, 미세먼지가 우리나라에 미치는 것이 맞을까? </span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">하고 알아보는&#160;</span></b><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">빅데이터 분석</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/63a702769353e79d3f31a95e24a3f3bd4bc48d92\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/63a702769353e79d3f31a95e24a3f3bd4bc48d92\" data-origin-width=\"1889\" data-origin-height=\"881\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/60aa88529f1885c54145325c1ee3d8d7bdcb68d1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/60aa88529f1885c54145325c1ee3d8d7bdcb68d1\" data-origin-width=\"1901\" data-origin-height=\"835\"><div class=\"figcaption\">풍향, 풍속 확인</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6fb55dc8001d46c25835bcdf718f4c33c400b49d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6fb55dc8001d46c25835bcdf718f4c33c400b49d\" data-origin-width=\"932\" data-origin-height=\"570\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fd6767c89b3afd1438a0615276c538002096cddc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fd6767c89b3afd1438a0615276c538002096cddc\" data-origin-width=\"1857\" data-origin-height=\"816\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>풍향,풍속 데이터를 조회할 수 있습니다.<br>&#160;<br><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxRnViAjBw7PX7gTzqftR5nUaV-w7mdFteZUAdNkf_ud9ZX9mjJ6ACzWfrhhAepMI8b/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxRnViAjBw7PX7gTzqftR5nUaV-w7mdFteZUAdNkf_ud9ZX9mjJ6ACzWfrhhAepMI8b/exec</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"기상청 GTS 통합 관측 지도 (TAC / BUFR / SHIP)\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxRnViAjBw7PX7gTzqftR5nUaV-w7mdFteZUAdNkf_ud9ZX9mjJ6ACzWfrhhAepMI8b/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxRnViAjBw7PX7gTzqftR5nUaV-w7mdFteZUAdNkf_ud9ZX9mjJ6ACzWfrhhAepMI8b/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxRnViAjBw7PX7gTzqftR5nUaV-w7mdFteZUAdNkf_ud9ZX9mjJ6ACzWfrhhAepMI8b/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxRnViAjBw7PX7gTzqftR5nUaV-w7mdFteZUAdNkf_ud9ZX9mjJ6ACzWfrhhAepMI8b/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">기상청 GTS 통합 관측 지도 (TAC / BUFR / SHIP)</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">3.<br> 위 2개의 api웹앱을 각각을 만들어서 테스트가 완료가 되면,</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">2개 웹앱기능을 합친 웹앱을 만들면 됩니다.</span></b><br><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size26\"> 직접 실험을 할 수 없는,&#160;&#160;</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size26\">서로 연관이 있을 것으로 추측되는 빅데이터를 수집하면</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size26\">또 하나의 탐구 분석이 됩니다.<br></span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size26\">-물론, 필요충분조건이 아니기에 조심해야 하는 상황이지만</span></b><br>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
